        "@value": "Nov 28 &#038; 29 | Inferno: A Hip Hop Opera"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;re:Naissance presents Inferno, a hip-hop opera by Omari Newton and Amy Lee Lavoie, in an exclusive concert performance of its music and script. Blending hip-hop, rap, beat boxing, sampling, R&amp;B, &hellip; &lt;a href=&quot;https://reopera.ca/event/nov-28-29-inferno-a-hip-hop-opera/&quot; class=&quot;more-link&quot;&gt;Continue reading &lt;span class=&quot;screen-reader-text&quot;&gt;Nov 28 &#038; 29 | Inferno: A Hip Hop Opera&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;meta-nav&quot;&gt;&rarr;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
      }
