        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Join re:Naissance, TDYVR, and MOVE37XR for Vancouver’s first-ever Immersive Jam Session—a night where technologists, performers, and digital dreamers collide to create new worlds in real time. Explore four interactive showcase &hellip; &lt;a href=&quot;https://reopera.ca/event/nov-25-creative-collisions-open-screen-open-mic-open-jam/&quot; class=&quot;more-link&quot;&gt;Continue reading &lt;span class=&quot;screen-reader-text&quot;&gt;Nov 25 | Creative Collisions: Open Screen. Open Mic. Open Jam&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;meta-nav&quot;&gt;&rarr;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
