        "@value": "Eurydice: Live From The Underworld"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;An interactive, digital live stream featuring the characters and worlds from OrpheusVR. Local audiences can attend the live stream as guests in the Telus Theatre and watch the inner workings of this motion capture operatic performance. Online audiences can experience the digital live stream via Youtube Live. Find out more about OrpheusVR! Tickets &nbsp; Team &hellip; &lt;a href=&quot;https://reopera.ca/event/eurydice-live-from-the-underworld/&quot; class=&quot;more-link&quot;&gt;Continue reading &lt;span class=&quot;screen-reader-text&quot;&gt;Eurydice: Live From The Underworld&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;meta-nav&quot;&gt;&rarr;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
      }
