        "@value": "Angel&#8217;s Bone: Canadian Opera Premiere"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;This 2017 Pulitzer Prize winning opera, Angel’s Bone, by Chinese-American Composer Du Yun and Canadian Librettist Royce Vavrek, is a newly-imagined and all-Canadian production debuting at IndieFest 2022. Addressing the &hellip; &lt;a href=&quot;https://reopera.ca/event/angels-bone-canadian-opera-premiere-nov-26/&quot; class=&quot;more-link&quot;&gt;Continue reading &lt;span class=&quot;screen-reader-text&quot;&gt;Angel&#8217;s Bone: Canadian Opera Premiere&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;meta-nav&quot;&gt;&rarr;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
      }
    ],
