        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;A musical sampling platter of vocal chamber music by nine exciting BIPOC (Black, Indigenous, or People of Colour) composers. BIPOC Voices Director Rich Coburn has curated a dynamic program of &hellip; &lt;a href=&quot;https://reopera.ca/event/imaginarium-concert-iv-curated-by-rich-coburn/&quot; class=&quot;more-link&quot;&gt;Continue reading &lt;span class=&quot;screen-reader-text&quot;&gt;Imaginarium Concert IV &#8211; Curated by Rich Coburn&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;meta-nav&quot;&gt;&rarr;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
